/-!
# Source-generated observer-submission / external-Payment legislation span

The canonical rooted submission and the responsibility-bearing Payment are
two different actual occurrences generated by one exact right replay.  This
zero-choice carrier retains that span and reads the already installed
proof-carrying legislation, consumer, revolutionary branch, augmented U8 core
and runtime from the Payment endpoint.

It does not transport by current equality, identify the two occurrences, fill
the empty local ledger, or accept a Payment, row, policy, core, runtime or next
from the caller.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ProcessGame
namespace Society
namespace M14SourceGeneratedPostSettlementObserverSubmissionExternalPaymentLegislation

noncomputable section

open ResponsibilityLifecycle LivingLawEvolution ConstructiveRoot
open ConstructiveRoot.RootInquiryCompletion
open Renewal Legislation
open M9ProofCarryingRenewalInquiryRoot
open M9ProofCarryingRenewalU8Failure
